<!--
  A placeholder mark: the app's initial inside the adaptive-icon safe zone.

  Drawn as a vector rather than shipped as five PNG densities, so the generated project has a
  usable icon on day one and replacing it is a single file. Adaptive icons are 108x108 with only
  the middle 72x72 guaranteed visible — every OEM crops the rest to its own shape — so nothing
  meaningful goes outside roughly 24..84.
-->
